Package: fable.tbats
Type: Package
Title: BATS and TBATS Models for Fable
Version: 0.6.0
Author: Juraj Szitas
Maintainer: <juraj.szitas13@gmail.com>
Description: BATS and TBATS exponential smoothing state space models
    (De Livera, Hyndman and Snyder, 2011) for fable, with automatic selection
    of the Box-Cox transformation, trend, damping, seasonal harmonics and
    ARMA errors. The fitting is implemented in C++ in this package.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports: 
    stats,
    distributional,
    tsibble,
    fabletools,
    rlang,
    generics,
    Rcpp
Suggests: 
    tsibbledata,
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LinkingTo: 
    Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++17
